    "When editing a non-base language, a banner appears at the top of the canvas reminding you which language you're in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quan editeu un idioma no bàsic, apareix un bàner a la part superior del llenç que us recorda en quin idioma esteu."
          }
